This project includes the streaming inference core, pure NumPy DSP and
stateful ONNX model files from arpesenti/livekit-plugins-hush, commit
ab84d83864003d835013b4e914fca8df83b2cbc6, licensed under Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/arpesenti/livekit-plugins-hush
See licenses/livekit-plugins-hush-LICENSE and vendor-manifest.json.

The Hush model derives from pulp-vision/Hush and DeepFilterNet:
https://github.com/pulp-vision/Hush
https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet
Model card: https://huggingface.co/weya-ai/hush

The vendored core/DSP files match the pinned upstream Git blobs. The
Wyoming bridge, settings, recording/deletion controls and web UI are
separate project code. The rest of the LiveKit agent framework is not
included. No speech-to-text model or user recordings are distributed.
